1185
01:31:42,480 --> 01:31:46,404
It's doing one analysis per repo, and a missing repo fails cleanly.

1186
01:31:46,720 --> 01:31:47,108
Great.

1187
01:31:47,360 --> 01:31:54,212
So all of this is done exactly as it's supposed to, but now the next step is to do the UI.

1188
01:31:54,400 --> 01:32:00,160
