01:39:52,814 --> 01:40:00,832
It ran it against this current repository, and it found five page routes, two server actions, two layouts, and one

1283
01:40:01,127 --> 01:40:04,068
middleware file, all found using Find and Grep.

1284
01:40:04,526 --> 01:40:13,152
And it also fed it a real world Next.js example app and found six controllers, four services, five modules, five entities,

1285
01:40:13,312 --> 01:40:15,072
and 21 routes.

1286
01:40:15,438 --> 01:40:18,272
So the last thing to do is to check it out in the browser.

