1350
01:45:26,446 --> 01:45:31,908
Until now, we've been mostly building on top of parser, but here we're extending the parser itself.

1351
01:45:32,206 --> 01:45:39,428
And whenever you touch something this central, you want to make sure that the code bases that already worked still behave exactly the same.

1352
01:45:39,790 --> 01:45:48,480
So before and after this change, we run the parser against the same existing projects and compare the edge list, and they need to be 100%

1353
01:45:49,134 --> 01:45:49,828
identical.

1354
01:45:50,080 --> 01:45:53,113
Also, express routes are not extracted.

1355
01:45:53,262 --> 01:45:55,236
We're deliberately leaving that out.

1356
01:45:55,600 --> 01:46:03,204
Because express routes can be composed through routers, variables, and middleware, which makes them much harder to recover reliably from static code.

1357
01:46:03,630 --> 01:46:06,404
So we're following the same rule from the last phase.

1358
01:46:06,798 --> 01:46:10,240
If we can determine a route exactly, we don't show it.

1359
01:46:10,560 --> 01:46:14,980
Express still gets its framework roles, but the route table stays empty.

